the reviewer's name is not a review. This note replaces it.

VERDICT: FAIL, round 2. One blocking finding (B1). The opus does not close.


WHAT I RAN

  bisellium verify W-020 --studio studio --repo .        see NOTE ON THE TESTS GATE
  npm test                                              exit 0
  npm run -s check -- studio --repo .                    PASS — 0 blocking, 41 advisory
  a first-hour drive of all four verbs against a fresh copy of
